OL,3,ATrump shakes hands with Putin and Xi
OL,4,Aahead of historic talks in China
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a carefully choreographed
OL,7,Fhandshake and hug between Trump and Xi
OL,8,Fon the tarmac, the US president later
OL,9,Fgreeted and exchanged pleasantries with
OL,10,FPutin ahead of a reception.
OL,12,FTrump and Putin are expected to hold
OL,13,Fone-on-one talks on the sidelines of
OL,14,Fthe summit on Thursday, in which the
OL,15,Fwar in Ukraine could be discussed.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
