OL,3,AIsraeli military launches rare ground
OL,4,Aoperation in Gaza beyond Yellow Line
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Israeli military said the
OL,7,F"targeted" operation aimed to dismantle
OL,8,Fa "terror tunnel" west of the so-called
OL,9,FYellow Line, which marks the more than
OL,10,F60% of Gaza's territory occupied by
OL,11,FIsrael.
OL,13,FThe Palestinian armed group Hamas,
OL,14,Fwhich controls the rest of Gaza,
OL,15,Faccused Israel of a "flagrant
OL,16,Fviolation" of the October 2025
OL,17,Fceasefire agreement.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
